{"success":true,"message":"操作成功！","code":200,"result":{"updateBy":"admin","fdFlowstatus":0,"createBy":"bhadmin","createTime":"2025-08-22 13:36:47","updateTime":"2025-09-02 10:28:30","fdFlowdesc":"所属栏目-文创--文创征集-创意征集(北海公园主站)","delFlag":"0","id":"740ab0271e1e4044aa4e0b211e88f323","sysOrgCode":"A03","tenantId":"0","fdIsExternalLinks":"1","fdExternalLinksUrl":null,"fdSiteId":"b91a543a5c3c48488c8cf7e86d0b4700","fdH5Picture":null,"fdRangeId":"1","fdColumnId":"fda9014a60804d8ca3a328f573cb0620","fdLabelId":null,"fdTitle":"所属栏目-文创--文创征集","fdSubTitle":"1","fdSubTitleTwo":null,"fdContent":"<div class=\"ace-line\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2329; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-node=\"true\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-leaf=\"true\"><img src=\"http://10.2.10.189/api/sys/common/static/jeditor/微信图片_20250821165359_1755766466193.png?token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VybmFtZSI6ImFkbWluIiwib3JnY29kZSI6IkEwMSIsInVzZXJpZCI6ImU5Y2EyM2Q2OGQ4ODRkNGViYjE5ZDA3ODg5NzI3ZGFlIiwiY2xpZW50VHlwZSI6InBjIiwiZXhwIjoxNzU2Nzg1NzkzfQ.hsTAecgzdsL34n2lnFJaGWvd4iPO_CCtGKH0UgEEJhw&amp;_t=1755766466\" alt=\"\" width=\"641\" height=\"360\" /></span></div>\r\n<div class=\"ace-line\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2329; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-node=\"true\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-leaf=\"true\">当我们漫步在绿意盎然的庭院，或是穿梭于曲径通幽的公园，总会被眼前错落有致的景致所打动 &mdash;&mdash; 这便是园林的魅力。园林，不仅是花草树木的简单组合，更是人类用智慧与审美雕琢的自然画卷，承载着地域文化、生活哲学与生态智慧。让我们一同揭开园林的神秘面纱，探寻其中的学问与故事。</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"ace-line heading-h2\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 36px 0px 18px; padding: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 30px; color: #1f2329; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-node=\"true\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-leaf=\"true\">什么是园林？</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"ace-line\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2329; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-node=\"true\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-leaf=\"true\">从字面上看，&ldquo;园&rdquo; 指种植花木的地方，&ldquo;林&rdquo; 则代表成片的树木，而 &ldquo;园林&rdquo; 的内涵远不止于此。它是以自然山水为骨架，通过</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bold;\" data-leaf=\"true\">筑山、理水、植物配置、建筑营造</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-leaf=\"true\">等手法，将自然美与人工美巧妙融合的空间艺术。无论是占地广阔的皇家园林，还是精致小巧的私家花园，都遵循着 &ldquo;虽由人作，宛自天开&rdquo; 的原则，力求在有限的空间里再现自然的神韵。</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"ace-line\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2329; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-node=\"true\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-leaf=\"true\">园林的核心在于 &ldquo;意境&rdquo; 的营造。设计者不仅要考虑视觉上的和谐，更要通过山水布局、匾额题刻、植物寓意等，传递出特定的情感与哲思。比如，苏州园林中常见的 &ldquo;月洞门&rdquo;，既划分了空间，又像一幅流动的画框，让人在移步换景中感受 &ldquo;框景&rdquo; 的妙趣，暗含着中国人 &ldquo;以小见大&rdquo; 的审美追求。</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"ace-line heading-h2\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 36px 0px 18px; padding: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 30px; color: #1f2329; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-node=\"true\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-leaf=\"true\">园林的 &ldquo;四大要素&rdquo;</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"ace-line\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2329; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-node=\"true\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-leaf=\"true\">要读懂园林，先要认识构成它的基本元素。这些元素如同乐曲中的音符，在设计师的编排下奏响和谐的乐章。</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"ace-line\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2329; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-node=\"true\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bold;\" data-leaf=\"true\">山石</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-leaf=\"true\">是园林的 &ldquo;骨骼&rdquo;。它们或取自自然，或由工匠堆叠，形态各异：有的如猛虎下山，气势磅礴；有的似灵猴望月，憨态可掬。在江南园林中，太湖石以 &ldquo;瘦、透、漏、皱&rdquo; 闻名，石身多孔，雨水穿流时叮咚作响，光影透过石缝洒落，营造出空灵幽静的氛围。</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"ace-line\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2329; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-node=\"true\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bold;\" data-leaf=\"true\">水体</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-leaf=\"true\">是园林的 &ldquo;血脉&rdquo;。古人云 &ldquo;无水不成园&rdquo;，池塘、溪流、瀑布等水体不仅能调节气候、滋养植物，更能倒映天光云影，让园林显得灵动鲜活。颐和园的昆明湖借远山为背景，近观碧波荡漾，远眺层峦叠嶂，形成了 &ldquo;山因水活，水因山转&rdquo; 的画卷。</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"ace-line\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2329; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-node=\"true\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bold;\" data-leaf=\"true\">植物</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-leaf=\"true\">是园林的 &ldquo;衣裳&rdquo;。不同季节的花木为园林换上新装：春有桃花灼灼，夏有荷叶田田，秋有桂香浮动，冬有梅影疏斜。更妙的是，植物还被赋予了象征意义 &mdash;&mdash; 松柏代表坚韧，翠竹寓意高洁，莲花象征清白，让园林成为 &ldquo;无声的诗&rdquo;。</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"ace-line\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2329; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-node=\"true\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bold;\" data-leaf=\"true\">建筑</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-leaf=\"true\">是园林的 &ldquo;眼睛&rdquo;。亭台楼阁、轩榭廊桥不仅是休憩之所，更是观赏风景的最佳视角。比如，站在西湖的 &ldquo;湖心亭&rdquo; 中，能 360 度欣赏湖光山色；苏州拙政园的 &ldquo;与谁同坐轩&rdquo;，扇形的窗棂正对着月亮升起的方向，暗合 &ldquo;与谁同坐？明月、清风、我&rdquo; 的意境。</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"ace-line heading-h2\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 36px 0px 18px; padding: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 30px; color: #1f2329; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-node=\"true\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-leaf=\"true\">园林的 &ldquo;多样面孔&rdquo;</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"ace-line\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2329; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-node=\"true\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-leaf=\"true\">园林如同人类文明的镜子，在不同地域、不同时代呈现出迥异的风貌。</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"ace-line\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2329; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-node=\"true\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bold;\" data-leaf=\"true\">中国古典园林</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-leaf=\"true\">是世界园林艺术的瑰宝，分为皇家园林与私家园林。皇家园林如北京颐和园、承德避暑山庄，规模宏大，气势恢宏，既体现皇权的威严，又融入江南水乡的灵秀；私家园林以苏州园林为代表，如</span>网师园、<span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-leaf=\"true\">留园，面积虽小，却通过 &ldquo;借景、对景、框景&rdquo; 等手法，营造出 &ldquo;壶中天地&rdquo; 的意境，一步一景，耐人寻味。</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"ace-line\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2329; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-node=\"true\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bold;\" data-leaf=\"true\">日本园林</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-leaf=\"true\">则透着禅意与极简之美。枯山水庭院用白砂模拟流水，用石块象征山峦，无需一草一木，却能让人感受到山水的静谧；池泉园则以池塘为中心，搭配石灯笼、小桥，营造出 &ldquo;物哀&rdquo;&ldquo;侘寂&rdquo; 的美学氛围，让人在清幽中沉淀心灵。</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"ace-line\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2329; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-node=\"true\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bold;\" data-leaf=\"true\">西方园林</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-leaf=\"true\">则展现出几何之美与秩序感。法国凡尔赛宫的园林，以中轴线为核心，修剪整齐的绿篱、对称的喷泉、放射状的道路，彰显着人工对自然的改造与掌控；英国自然风景园则反其道而行之，保留自然的起伏地貌，种植成片的草坪与树林，宛如一幅展开的风景画。</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"ace-line heading-h2\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 36px 0px 18px; padding: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 30px; color: #1f2329; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-node=\"true\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-leaf=\"true\">园林的 &ldquo;现代意义&rdquo;</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"ace-line\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2329; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-node=\"true\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-leaf=\"true\">在快节奏的现代生活中，园林的价值愈发凸显。它不仅是休闲游赏的场所，更是城市的 &ldquo;绿肺&rdquo;，能净化空气、调节气温、涵养水源；它是生物的 &ldquo;家园&rdquo;，为鸟类、昆虫提供栖息之地，维护着城市的生态平衡；它更是文化的 &ldquo;载体&rdquo;，让我们在触摸历史的同时，学会与自然和谐共处。</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"ace-line\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2329; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-node=\"true\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-leaf=\"true\">如今，&ldquo;口袋公园&rdquo;&ldquo;屋顶花园&rdquo;&ldquo;社区园林&rdquo; 等新兴形式不断涌现，让园林走进寻常百姓的生活。当我们在钢筋水泥的城市中寻得一片绿意，不妨放慢脚步，看看山石的纹理、听听流水的声音、闻闻花草的芬芳 &mdash;&mdash; 或许，这便是园林给予我们最珍贵的礼物：在自然与人文的交融中，找回内心的宁静与诗意。</span><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">&nbsp;</span></p>","fdAnnex":null,"fdPicture":null,"fdTopping":"2","fdTopSorting":1,"fdPublishingUnit":null,"fdAuditStatus":"2","fdReadingTimes":"6","fdIsPicture":"1","fdReviewedBy":null,"fdPublisher":"admin","fdPublishTime":null,"fdUpPicture":null,"fdPictureWidth":550,"fdPictureHeight":360,"fdTitleTwo":"1","previousId":null,"nextId":null,"realname":null,"fdKeywordQuery":null,"fdSynopsis":null},"timestamp":1791459038962}